# PrimeUI licence key from https://primeui.store (PrimeVue 5+ requires one; a free
# community tier exists). Verified offline in the browser, so it is embedded in the
# built bundle - it is not a secret, but it must be present at BUILD time or PrimeVue
# logs a warning and paints an "invalid licence" banner in the corner.
VITE_PRIMEUI_LICENSE=
